panels.policy.help:
Switching a policy takes time and political power:
· Pay [[politics:{{cost}}]] when you start, plus [[politics:-{{upkeep}}]] upkeep each turn while switching;
· Takes [[turn:{{days}}]] to finish; bonuses to finance, industry, manpower, [[occupation]] and so on approach the new policy gradually each turn;
· The target policy being switched to carries a clock marker; hover to see the remaining turns;
· Click the target again to cancel and return to the old policy; political power already paid and upkeep are not refunded, and switching again still takes time.

Policies always affect national output, [[occupation]] integration and [[politics]] income.

