panels.intel.state.rules:
Claimants: {{claimants}}
State center controller: {{controller}}
State center legal owner: {{legal}}
Figures are built/cap; pending buildings also occupy capacity.
[[factory]] and [[farm]] each have an independent cap equal to the number of provinces in the state ({{capacity}}).
[[infrastructure]] is capped at level {{max}} and only applies to provinces held by the state center's controller; provinces under other owners use level 0 multipliers.
At most one [[admin]] per state; when the state center is a core or [[occupation]] ≥50% it grants only [[politics:+1]]/[[turn]] and does not speed up occupation integration.

